\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Breaking-target selectivity test (development risk on each run's own validation split; refits reproduce logged risks to $\le 7\times 10^{-18}$). The gate's \emph  {accept} rate tracks label preservation ($8$ of $348$ hypotheses pass here, against $299$ of $299$ on the invariant graphs target), so the filter works; identification still fails ($0$ of $348$ carry $D_6$); repair never fires; and no arm ordering is detectable.}}{11}{table.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:breaking}{{7}{11}{Breaking-target selectivity test (development risk on each run's own validation split; refits reproduce logged risks to $\le 7\times 10^{-18}$). The gate's \emph {accept} rate tracks label preservation ($8$ of $348$ hypotheses pass here, against $299$ of $299$ on the invariant graphs target), so the filter works; identification still fails ($0$ of $348$ carry $D_6$); repair never fires; and no arm ordering is detectable}{table.7}{}}
