\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces E-S7: sealed-test risk of the frozen $120$-run candidates, refitted deterministically (reproducing logged development risk to $1.7\times 10^{-18}$) and scored once. The sealed split reproduces the development pattern: on the ring the LLM arms beat the non-LLM arms and the verifier-versus-fitness difference is undetected; on graphs no arm difference is detected and every arm sits far above the $0.351$ edge-count rule.}}{12}{table.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:holdout}{{8}{12}{E-S7: sealed-test risk of the frozen $120$-run candidates, refitted deterministically (reproducing logged development risk to $1.7\times 10^{-18}$) and scored once. The sealed split reproduces the development pattern: on the ring the LLM arms beat the non-LLM arms and the verifier-versus-fitness difference is undetected; on graphs no arm difference is detected and every arm sits far above the $0.351$ edge-count rule}{table.8}{}}
